# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for CI (TSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=.github/tsan.supp).
#
# Only third-party noise that cannot be fixed in this repository belongs here. Each entry needs a comment with the
# library, the symptom and a link to the upstream report. Races in code under src/, include/ or libs/ must be fixed,
# never suppressed.
#
# Example:
#   race:libssl.so
